t if AI could predict your perfect medication before you ever get sick?\",\n      \"controversy\": \"Will AI doctors replace human physicians, or is that just fearmongering?\",\n      \"statistic\": \"AI detects cancer with 95% accuracy – better than most radiologists. Ready for the revolution?\",\n      \"story\": \"When Sarah's routine scan revealed early cancer thanks to AI, it saved her life – here's how.\"\n    },\n    \"angles\": [\n      {\"angle\": \"Tech optimist: Breakthroughs in diagnostics and drug discovery\", \"relevance\": 9},\n      {\"angle\": \"Ethical concerns: Addressing bias and privacy in AI health data\", \"relevance\": 8},\n      {\"angle\": \"Business case: Investment opportunities and ROI in healthcare AI\", \"relevance\": 7},\n      {\"angle\": \"Patient stories: Real-world impact on lives saved\", \"relevance\": 9},\n      {\"angle\": \"Regulatory path: Navigating FDA approvals for AI tools\", \"relevance\": 6}\n    ],\n    \"questions\": {\n      \"analytical\": [\"How does AI accuracy compare across different cancer types and imaging modalities?\", \"What types of biases are present in AI training datasets for healthcare?\"],\n      \"practical\": [\"How can small clinics affordably implement AI diagnostic tools?\", \"What is the expected ROI timeline for hospital AI adoption?\"],\n      \"philosophical\": [\"Does greater AI reliance in medicine reduce human empathy in patient care?\", \"What does 'cure' mean in an era of predictive AI diagnostics?\"],\n      \"comparative\": [\"How does US AI healthcare regulation compare to EU GDPR standards?\", \"What are the cost and speed differences between AI vs traditional diagnostics?\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"suggestedOutline\": [\n    {\n      \"section\": \"Introduction\",\n      \"wordCount\": 150,\n      \"hooks\": [\"emotional\", \"statistic\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"section\": \"Diagnostic Revolution\",\n      \"wordCount\": 250,\n      \"hooks\": [\"story\"],\n      \"content\": \"AI imaging accuracy and speed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"section\": \"Drug Discovery and Personalized Medicine\",\n      \"wordCount\": 300,\n      \"hooks\": [\"curiosity\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"section\": \"Challenges and Ethical Considerations\",\n      \"wordCount\": 200,\n      \"hooks\": [\"controversy\"],\n      \"angle\": \"Ethical concerns\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"section\": \"The Path Forward\",\n      \"wordCount\": 100,\n      \"angle\": \"Tech optimist\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"difficulty\": \"medium\",\n    \"estimatedTime\": \"2-3 hours\",\n    \"targetAudience\": \"Tech enthusiasts, healthcare professionals, investors\",\n    \"targetWordCount\": 1000,\n    \"tone\": \"intermediate\",\n    \"voice\": \"first-person\",\n    \"relevanceScore\": 8.5,\n    \"outlineSections\": 5\n  }\n}",
